              highlighted: ["E","BC","CD"] },
            { text: "and further let {CB} also not have to {BD} the ratio which a square number has to a square number.",
              visible: NUM,
              highlighted: ["BC","BD"] },
            { text: "Let it be contrived that {E} is to {BC} as the square on {A} is to the square on {FG},",
